Z||000000||MooCow||04-13-2001||07:02 PM||||Okay well I am going to change the distributor now and see if that gets my car running since I still have no spark.  The ignition modual is good cause I went and had it tested.  Now when I change the distributor and hints I should know of??  Also do I have to bring the old one back at the same time I buy the new one for the core, or can I bring it back later on and still get the core money??<P>Thanks Ken||||reg||5
Z||000001||85Josh||04-13-2001||10:52 PM||||Make sure you get the engine on top dead center on #1 cyl, life sucks if you forget!<BR>The parts place will give you a refund for the core charge if you wait to bring the old one back.<P>------------------<BR>85 2M4(Lil' Bit)||||reg||1
